flowchart TB
  subgraph host[Owned hardware in development - CPU Linux target later]
    UI[Phone / desktop browser - React]
    API[FastAPI - authenticated HTTP]
    Worker[One durable worker]
    Audio[FFmpeg + whisper.cpp small.en]
    Agent[Bounded dialogue orchestrator]
    LLM[llama-server - Qwen 4B Q4_K_M]
    MCP[Private MCP server - stdio]
    Service[CalendarService - validation and proposals]
    DB[(SQLite WAL - events / conversations / proposals / jobs / audit)]
    Execute[Trusted approved-operation executor]
    Local[Local calendar adapter]
    Google[Google Calendar adapter]
    UI -->|Record / type / CRUD / accept| API
    API -->|Save capture or approved operation| DB
    DB -->|Claim leased job| Worker
    Worker --> Audio
    Audio -->|Transcript; remove temporary audio| Agent
    Agent <-->|Tool calls| LLM
    Agent <-->|MCP client| MCP
    MCP --> Service
    API --> Service
    Service -->|Stage exact proposal| DB
    DB -->|Poll preview and result| API
    API --> UI
    Worker --> Execute
    Execute --> Local
    Execute --> Google
    Local --> DB
    Google <-->|Observe and reconcile| DB
  end
  Google <-->|OAuth, minimal event fields, etags| Cloud[Google Calendar API]
  Cloud <--> Apple[Apple Calendar displays Google account]
  Future[Deferred planner / optimization] -.->|Future proposals through same service| Service
